        ("Do seamless leggings hide cellulite better than panelled leggings?", "Usually yes, though the reason is density rather than the missing seams. A seamless knit has no stitched panel join to thin out under stretch, and a heavier knit stays opaque and scatters light instead of following every contour. A thin seamless pair will still show texture."),
        ("What fabric weight should I look for if this is my main concern?", "Roughly 200 gsm and upwards, ideally with a doubled layer through the seat and upper thigh where the fabric stretches most. A matte finish helps as well, because a glossy surface reflects light and makes surface texture read more clearly."),
